Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.50,0:00:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光明与黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:04.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在陷入一片混乱的战国时代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了四魂之玉因缘际会聚在一起的伙伴们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿越五百年的时光
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后仅存的四魂之玉碎片引导着各自的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战国时代的传奇故事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:14.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:17.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒珊瑚犬夜叉还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各个勇者都已经立过大功
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:21.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就等我用震荡陀螺打败奈落了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于轮到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.15,0:00:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这集看我七宝大爷的表演吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:29.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:35.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I'm in a world （暧昧的世界） 奋力冲出吧{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:49.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对忧郁的现实生活{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:55.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在心中自我成长的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:01:01.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨夜的梦境及梦中残留的影像{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:06.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,断断续续提醒我「勇往直前」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:14.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破茧而出的我及含苞待放的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:19.24,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就将它禁锢起来吗{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:23.90,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,You can now dream （勇敢的梦想） 挥起舞动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:28.28,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Go and try （不顾一切的去尝试） 无尽的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.45,0:01:32.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你天长地久永不分离
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:35.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Do you need to cry （同样的哭泣） 和孤独相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.99,0:01:40.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Show me a day fight （直接应战） 每当伤心流泪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:47.16,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它成为坚定不移的梦想吧{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,累死了 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,累死了 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴 继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.08,0:02:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下好不好 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休息一下啦 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能休息一下下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.51,0:02:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的妖怪居然想吃我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:57.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:02.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢小看我 今天碰到我算你倒霉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.15,0:03:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要走了喔 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:09.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扔下我听到没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是…他是勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不会错的 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.47,0:03:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是传说中的勇士了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第130话 七宝绝招出动心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我爹还有我娘都已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.75,0:03:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是可以过的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还有这么多的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是很不错的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我反而替你担心 水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在人类的世界这么的乱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.87,0:03:53.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实你也不用替我担心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:03.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我遇见了七宝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我也一样 水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:12.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝这小子 怎么经过的每个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总是能和女孩子打成一片呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.22,0:04:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝这种作风
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:19.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会是受到身边那位仁兄的影响呀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要妖怪敢现身的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.63,0:04:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上帮你们收服它
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 要是躲在深山里面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:31.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕需要多花些时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.24,0:04:34.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这一点我也很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那关于这住宿问题…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:41.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论多久 都请你们一定要住下来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况允许的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.45,0:04:45.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能让村里的年轻姑娘们来照顾…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么晚饭时候 就叫她们过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好还能留下来过夜…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你太得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别生气嘛 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:01.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 太无趣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:04.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么打听 也不过是些杂碎妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟四魂之玉碎片也没什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难让人提起劲来耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:12.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位壮士 千万别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:14.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用理会这种村子了 不如还是快走…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:18.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:30.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:36.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝的同伴们都这么粗暴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:37.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别理他们 都是一些小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:41.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我可以靠嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.08,0:05:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们这就出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都拜托大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就拜托你了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.72,0:05:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不需要我出马吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说万一妖怪突然袭击村子怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 一切拜托大家了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我去附近稍微巡视一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.68,0:06:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪看到一定会很高兴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候一定会乐坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三 四
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们突然跑出来是想干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:50.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来拜见狐妖大前辈 七宝老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这年头 连妖怪的世界也乱得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:07:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那个坏蛋到处胡作非为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.15,0:07:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他坏蛋们也趁机为所欲为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此外我们狐妖一家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也被这些坏蛋追得到处逃窜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们五兄弟跟爹娘走散了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只好到处流浪 一边找寻爹娘
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在此时 我们听说了七宝老大您的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一群与坏蛋奈落战斗的勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:26.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他们之中不是有一个狐妖勇者吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:35.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那的确是在说我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.06,0:07:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 我们会好好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你教教我们让我们变得跟你一样强
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你收我们为徒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.13,0:07:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其…其实我没那么厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:51.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会不会 老大的传说我们知道的很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家说你身为妖怪 却带领着巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:07:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师 南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带领好几位武艺高超的勇者的不就是七宝老大吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…带领他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫女
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:16.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖 好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉只不过是我的仆人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人类全都是靠我罩着他们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 请你把绝招传授给我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟奈落对打时总会有绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:41.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的绝招？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你们是指这招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.34,0:08:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:08:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请您就别再耍我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再耍我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有更厉害的绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更厉害的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像豆之浆啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感之冒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.49,0:09:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茶之水啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像这么厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.62,0:09:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你们说的是风之伤吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请务必传授给我们 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:30.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不…不过呢…这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.51,0:09:37.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几个在这里给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是个男子汉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:46.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:54.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道妖怪出现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快借给我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:05.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.61,0:10:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:13.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 风之伤到底要怎么发动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛突然问这个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.32,0:10:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想用用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要让自己变得更厉害才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样子乱挥一通是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你 你的鼻子不是很灵吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.43,0:10:32.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定闻得到妖气的流动吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就从那里喀喀喀穿过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:38.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后嗤叭叭就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.81,0:10:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么喀喀喀嗤叭叭的 我不懂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 就是喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么办法嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.32,0:10:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:58.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喀喀喀然后嗤叭叭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到没有 就像这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:11.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 门打坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:15.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 七宝…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然给我溜掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.21,0:11:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会向那个犬夜叉讨教 我也太笨了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:36.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚当然是去找来村子捣乱的妖怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 差点忘了有东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.04,0:11:46.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我还要继续去找妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:50.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪你先回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:52.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 自己要小心点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:58.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们什么时候来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.80,0:12:09.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.93,0:12:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想告诉你们 那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:14.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有什么风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真厉害 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以这么高明的手段耍了一个人类少女
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦 我并不是在耍她
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.31,0:12:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们狐妖来说 欺骗凡人可是流传下来的传统
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:29.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们岂能输给狸猫它们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.42,0:12:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算什么时候让那个小女孩尝尝苦头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:36.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有要…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝老大亲自出马 一定是更有威力的花招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好兴奋呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好想看 好想看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这些小鬼到底在胡说些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开 小狐狸们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这家伙就是危害村民的妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得马上去通知犬夜叉才行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.85,0:13:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底知不知道这位是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.99,0:13:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位就是我们狐妖界鼎鼎有名的七宝老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.50,0:13:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的应该是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.37,0:13:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不乖乖的向我们赔罪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然要你好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候 七宝老大的威力会吓死你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会吓死你 吓死你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:30.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干…干嘛抓着我不放
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 就让我陪你过几招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:36.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有请老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.59,0:13:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我随时奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 脱逃之术
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:50.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:59.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你是在耍本大爷是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 这几个小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算甩掉它们了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问老大你真的是狐妖界的勇者七宝大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:26.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当…当然是了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.87,0:14:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是七宝 错不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝老大应该很厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没…没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该也有绝招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.68,0:14:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你刚刚为什么要逃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:43.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因…因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.92,0:14:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.82,0:14:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因…因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大你不是要去耍她吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.53,0:14:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请老大露两手给我们瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好想看 好想看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.10,0:15:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这种迷惑人类少女这种事 我并不…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.41,0:15:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.44,0:15:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大 你真的是狐妖界的勇士七宝大人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我就是七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如假包换
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好香喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:35.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.24,0:15:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:44.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看镖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 讨厌啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.32,0:15:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们别欺负人家啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.96,0:15:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:08.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.97,0:16:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没…没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你做的吗 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:25.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:32.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.63,0:16:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身都湿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下知道厉害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:45.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.41,0:16:47.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:51.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水…水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:09.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实…这并不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初恋又再一次的结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.11,0:17:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:21.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道厉害了吧 臭丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚竟然被你们的那点小把戏给耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次 一定要和你们一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都给我闭嘴 什么老大嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的小狐狸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你肯乖乖向本大爷赔罪的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你无缘无故跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不会…就不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:59.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭…臭小子 讨打是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:02.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你出来捣乱 我就不会做出那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪也就不会误会我讨厌我了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭…臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.24,0:18:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:24.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就轮到你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:34.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.59,0:18:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了 是妖气的流动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大终于使出绝招了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.87,0:18:54.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:00.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这招叫做…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比风之伤更厉害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:14.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.63,0:19:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛… 心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们也一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不愧是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老大
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个真是受益不浅呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.33,0:19:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我们使用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你们用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.86,0:19:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样以后我们什么都不用怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能够去找爹和娘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:02.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然时间很短暂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们永远不会忘记老大的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.94,0:20:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢老大的教导
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初恋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再让我碰见 绝对不放过他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.81,0:20:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:47.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全身麻痹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.65,0:20:51.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于把妖怪收服了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.99,0:20:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.39,0:20:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南无阿弥陀佛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常谢谢你们 真是辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:07.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实也不是什么了不起的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.90,0:21:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两三下就搞定了 心里还真有点失望呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛七宝 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说那妖怪一下就把你打败了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:22.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不在乎这种事咧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…水纪…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.97,0:21:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了什么呀 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么人家这么讨厌你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.94,0:21:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛痛痛…你在干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:52.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这两个人在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是佛祖对他的考验吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,水纪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:24.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今内心充满着悲伤的话{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.42,0:22:40.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管靠着我哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.81,0:22:46.94,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.95,0:22:50.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I get   I get   I get   get the dreaming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:56.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像现在这样{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.95,0:23:06.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come my way  这点黑暗之尘
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.92,0:23:14.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Come close to me  现在灯已照亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.93,0:23:18.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}I'll be with you  I'll be with you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.47,0:23:22.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是简简单单的陪在你身边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.70,0:23:29.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}So Come my way{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:53.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家正要开始调查鬼女部落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.54,0:23:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏弥勒法师又犯了色戒了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.57,0:23:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.51,0:23:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底你跟弥勒法师有没有怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.57,0:23:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.41,0:24:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次去白灵山的时候 你不是跟他单独相处吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有留下甜蜜的回忆吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讨厌啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.58,0:24:06.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟弥勒法师之间什么关系也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.35,0:24:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是一直都觉得弥勒法师也很喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.39,0:24:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观音像挂轴 被诅咒的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.79,0:24:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有性命交关的时候 才会说出真心话吧
